<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Welcome to HackByteCodex</title>
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
        body { 
            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, sans-serif; 
            background: #0a0a0f; 
            padding: 40px 20px; 
            color: #e2e8f0;
        }
        .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; }
        .card { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0f1117 0%, #1a1d2e 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.2);
            border-radius: 20px; 
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 25px 50px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }
        .header { 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5 0%, #7c3aed 50%, #2563eb 100%);
            padding: 40px 30px; 
            text-align: center; 
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: -50%;
            left: -50%;
            width: 200%;
            height: 200%;
            background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(255,255,255,0.08) 0%, transparent 60%);
        }
        .header-logo {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #fff;
            letter-spacing: -1px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .header-logo span { color: #93c5fd; }
        .header h1 { 
            margin-top: 16px;
            font-size: 32px; 
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #ffffff; 
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }
        .header p {
            margin-top: 8px;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75);
            font-size: 16px;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        .content { 
            padding: 36px 32px;
        }
        .greeting {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #e2e8f0;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }
        .text {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 15px;
            line-height: 1.7;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .alert-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.15) 0%, rgba(124, 58, 237, 0.1) 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
        .alert-box .label {
            font-size: 11px;
            font-weight: 700;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1.5px;
            color: #818cf8;
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }
        .alert-box .email-display {
            font-size: 16px;
            font-weight: 600;
            color: #c7d2fe;
        }
        .cta-section {
            text-align: center;
            margin: 32px 0;
        }
        .cta-section p {
            color: #94a3b8;
            font-size: 14px;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }
        .btn { 
            display: inline-block; 
            padding: 16px 40px; 
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #4f46e5, #7c3aed);
            color: #ffffff !important; 
            text-decoration: none !important; 
            border-radius: 12px; 
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 16px;
            letter-spacing: 0.3px;
            box-shadow: 0 8px 25px rgba(79, 70, 229, 0.4);
            transition: all 0.2s;
        }
        .warning-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.1) 0%, rgba(234, 88, 12, 0.05) 100%);
            border: 1px solid rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.25);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 16px 20px;
            margin: 24px 0;
            font-size: 13px;
            color: #fcd34d;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .warning-box strong { color: #f59e0b; }
        .features {
            margin: 24px 0;
        }
        .feature-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
            padding: 10px 0;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
        }
        .feature-item:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
        .feature-icon {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-top: 1px;
        }
        .feature-text {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #94a3b8;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }
        .feature-text strong { color: #cbd5e1; }
        .divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(99, 102, 241, 0.3), transparent);
            margin: 28px 0;
        }
        .footer { 
            padding: 24px 32px;
            background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            border-top: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            text-align: center;
        }
        .footer p { 
            font-size: 12px; 
            color: #475569;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }
        .footer a { color: #6366f1; text-decoration: none; }
        .google-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
            border-radius: 20px;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            font-size: 12px;
            color: #64748b;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrapper">
    <div class="card">
        <div class="header">
            <div class="header-logo">hackbyte<span>codex</span></div>
            <h1>🎉 Welcome Aboard!</h1>
            <p>Your account has been created via Google Sign-In</p>
        </div>

        <div class="content">
            <div class="google-badge">
                <span>🔐</span>
                <span>Signed in with Google</span>
            </div>

            <p class="greeting">Hi <%= fullName %>,</p>

            <p class="text">
                Welcome to <strong style="color:#818cf8;">HackByteCodex!</strong> — India's premier hackathon & tech community platform.
                We're thrilled to have you here. Your account has been automatically created using your Google account.
            </p>

            <div class="alert-box">
                <div class="label">Your registered email</div>
                <div class="email-display">📧 <%= email %></div>
            </div>

            <div class="warning-box">
                <strong>⚠️ Action Required — Set Your Password</strong><br>
                Since you signed in with Google, your account needs a password for direct login. 
                Please set your password now — this link is valid for <strong>24 hours</strong>.
            </div>

            <div class="cta-section">
                <p>Click below to set your password and unlock full access:</p>
                <a href="<%= setPasswordUrl %>" class="btn">🔑 Set My Password</a>
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <p class="text" style="margin-bottom: 12px;"><strong style="color:#cbd5e1;">With your new account you can:</strong></p>
            <div class="features">
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <span class="feature-icon">🏆</span>
                    <div class="feature-text"><strong>Compete in Hackathons</strong> — Register for upcoming events and challenges</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <span class="feature-icon">🎓</span>
                    <div class="feature-text"><strong>Connect with your College</strong> — Join your college chapter and club</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <span class="feature-icon">⭐</span>
                    <div class="feature-text"><strong>Earn Rewards & Rankings</strong> — Climb the leaderboard and unlock badges</div>
                </div>
                <div class="feature-item">
                    <span class="feature-icon">🤝</span>
                    <div class="feature-text"><strong>Network with 50K+ Builders</strong> — Collaborate and grow together</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="divider"></div>

            <p class="text" style="font-size: 13px;">
                If you didn't create this account or have any questions, contact us at 
                <a href="mailto:<%= supportEmail %>" style="color: #818cf8;"><%= supportEmail %></a>
            </p>
        </div>

        <div class="footer">
            <p>© <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> HackByteCodex. All rights reserved.<br>
            This email was sent to <%= email %> as part of your account creation.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>
</body>
</html>
